city snapshot-safe: batches 12 + 14 + 15 in one sign-off: shop windows only on the walls that face a street (the storefront back-wall gate, facade.hlsli:222), soft trash bags, and aviation beacons on the hand-built tall structures. 6 files on top of HEAD 67e6159 + batch 13 (snapshot 47), copied into the shared tree. Blobs written with git hash-object -w. MinGW syntax check in the shared tree: @SHAREDSYN@. facade.hlsli is HEAD's (with night B), changed in 3 lines: the shadeFacade signature, storefront, signBand. world.hlsl is HEAD's, changed in 1 line: the call.

